      "overall_description": "Acrisure Arena is a state-of-the-art, 11,000-seat multi-purpose venue located in the Coachella Valley. Renowned for its excellent sightlines, clean facilities, and modern architecture, it serves as the home ice for the Coachella Valley Firebirds while hosting a wide array of world-class concerts and live events. Despite the premium pricing typical of large-scale event centers, visitors frequently commend its efficient operations, professional staff, and the overall quality of the event experience.",
      "service_description": null,
      "ambience_description": "The atmosphere is energetic and professional, characterized by a clean, futuristic design that feels both spacious and welcoming. It provides a comfortable, well-organized setting for high-profile sports and entertainment.",
      "amenities_description": "The facility is equipped with numerous restrooms, various food and beverage concessions throughout the levels, and dedicated merchandise outlets. It also features a connected ice skating rink and a large screen to enhance the event experience.",
      "unique_selling_points": "The arena is celebrated for having no bad seats in the house, offering excellent, unobstructed views regardless of the section. Its efficient, modern design makes navigation easy and ensures quick entry and exit for large crowds.",
      "neighborhood_description": "The arena is situated in a convenient location right off the freeway, making it easily accessible for visitors traveling from surrounding regions. It is a prominent, well-regarded addition to the local desert landscape.",
      "physical_setting_description": "Located in the desert valley near the freeway, this modern and clean arena provides a climate-controlled indoor environment. It features a well-designed layout that ensures unobstructed views from every seat, including the upper sections.",
      "customer_demographics_description": null,
